  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: YsgramorTombDelve
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118492191588420
    - rid: 1790118492191588421
    - rid: 1790118492191588422
    - rid: 1790118492191588423
    - rid: 1790118492191588424
    - rid: 1790118492191588425
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: You hanging in there, Shield-Sister?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118492191588426
    - rid: 1790118492191588427
    - rid: 1790118492191588428
    - rid: 1790118492191588429
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Could you jerks call me by my name?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118492191588430
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Sorry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118492191588431
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, you won't have to brave the elements any longer, Natsuki; we're
      here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118492191588432
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889408
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki, that friend told you that we'd need Wuuthrad to get in?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889409
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Then you'll probably need to put it in the statue's hands, it looks like
      it'll fit.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889411
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki gets up on the statue's pedestal, putting Wuuthrad in its place.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889412
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: This lowers a stone that was blocking the way further into the tomb.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889413
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do I have to leave it in here for it to stay open?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889414
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '''Cause, uh, I wouldn''t have a weapon otherwise.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889415
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Only one way to find out.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889416
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki takes Wuuthrad back from the statue, which does not raise the
      rock back into place.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889418
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki hops off of the statue's pedestal.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's just get this over with.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You got something to say, Vilkas?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889420
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know if I can help you all with this task...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889427
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Over the course of our journey here, the beast blood has been calling
      to me, far stronger than I've ever felt before.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889428
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe because I've finally held it in for too long, maybe because it
      knows that this place could be the death of it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: What I do know, is that I cannot fight in this state without losing myself
      completely.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I understand, brother. I've had days like that before, too.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Then we shall continue without you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889429
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889430
    - rid: 1790118514879889432
    - rid: 1790118514879889434
    - rid: 1790118514879889436
    - rid: 1790118514879889617
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you guys hear a faint sound like flowing water, too?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889437
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: This is the first time Wuuthrad has been whole since the second era.
      If we're really the first people to dive this far into the tomb in a thousand
      years-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889438
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: It's possible that this place has partially succumbed to the pressures
      of the Sea of Ghosts.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889439
    - rid: 1790118514879889440
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I thought this was Ysgramor's tomb, why are there so many coffins-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889441
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7ff2676adccfc34da5aff61a79ac81e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>All the living shall fear the dead!</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889495
    - rid: 1790118514879889496
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Companions of old; they won't let us through without a fight-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889497
    - rid: 1790118514879889498
    - rid: 1790118514879889499
    - rid: 1790118514879889500
    - rid: 1790118514879889501
    - rid: 1790118514879889510
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The group draws their weapons, ready to face their spectral foe.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889502
    - rid: 1790118514879889503
    - rid: 1790118514879889504
    - rid: 1790118514879889505
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889506
    - rid: 1790118514879889507
    - rid: 1790118514879889508
    - rid: 1790118514879889509
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So you're telling me that ghost are just... a thing?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889607
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And they're trying to kill us?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889609
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, yes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: What corner of Tamriel have you come from, to not know to rightfully
      fear ghosts?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889610
    - rid: 1790118514879889612
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, okay.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889611
    - rid: 1790118514879889613
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's just keep going...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889614
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, <i>there's</i> the water.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889615
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And more ghosts.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889618
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Greeeat</SineText>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889619
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889620
    - rid: 1790118514879889621
    - rid: 1790118514879889622
    - rid: 1790118514879889623
    - rid: 1790118514879889624
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you think that these ghosts could eat if they had food?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889625
    - rid: 1790118514879889626
    - rid: 1790118514879889627
    - rid: 1790118539274485833
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118514879889628
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm... since their bodies are physical enough to be struck, it's likely
      that they could eat food if offered.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485830
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: We're in a tomb so old that water is coming from the walls, getting attacked
      by <b>the</b> spirits of ages past-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485829
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And <i>that's</i> what the two of you are worried about?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485831
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I was just curious...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485832
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485834
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Ahh...!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485835
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm, what's the Farkas?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He's probably rattled by all the cobwebs and huge spider eggs.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485836
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas, you're scared of spiders?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485837
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... aye.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Something about they way they move-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: And those eyes?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: They're just... wrong, those things.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: I... didn't know that about you, Farkas.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Really? You've known him for longer than I have, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485838
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: He doesn't really talk much about those sorts of things.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485839
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: I won't be able to continue on, the two of you will have to keep going
      without me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Figures that both of the brothers would give up halfway through...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485840
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: While I respect Farkas as a warrior-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485841
    - rid: 1790118539274485842
    - rid: 1790118539274485843
    - rid: 1790118539274485844
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela quickly pulls her bow back, firing it at a spider that thinks he's
      being sneaky.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485845
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Killing it in a single shot.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485846
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: But I don't get it- they're very easy to deal with; why be afraid?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Well that's because he's scared of the spiders themselves, not what they
      can do to him, I guess.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485847
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: I suppose you're right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485848
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485849
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: You know-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485850
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I've been through three of these ancient Nordic ruins by now, and all
      three of them have had these hallways with little alcoves in them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: The ancient Nords often communed directly to their ancestors, often by
      speaking to their corpses.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485851
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: The niches in the walls are practical for that purpose.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And the ancestors actually talked back?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485852
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Allegedly. The Nordic dead aren't nearly as vocal anymore.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485853
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: The Dark Elves have similar practices in Morrowind; ancestor worship.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... hm.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485854
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I've got a lot of questions for {mc} when I see him next.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485855
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, Farkas had the witch heads, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485856
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't worry, he passed them to me before he left to go back to his brother.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485857
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you not see that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess not.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485859
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485860
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh goody, more of these standing coffins-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485861
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7ff2676adccfc34da5aff61a79ac81e, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=1>Who dares disturb the dead?</SineText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485862
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485863
    - rid: 1790118539274485864
    - rid: 1790118539274485866
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118539274485867
    - rid: 1790118539274485868
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh hey, is that the brezier {mc} told me to throw the witch head into-)
